inst our team\'s interest when they\'re so close to victory.\n\nReason:\nMy teammate has only 4 cards left and just established control with ♣5. By passing, I allow them to potentially gain a free play if the landlord also passes. This maximizes our team\'s chances of winning since helping my teammate empty their 4 cards is much more achievable than me emptying my 17 cards. Taking control away from my teammate would be strategically poor.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
