s by letting my teammate maintain control when they\'re so close to victory.\n\nReason: My teammate has only 2 cards left and is currently winning the trick with ♠8. By passing, I allow them to potentially win control and play out their remaining cards. If the landlord passes, my teammate leads with 2 cards and likely wins. If the landlord plays, they burn a card. I preserve my high cards (K, 2, BlackJoker) for critical moments.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
